# Direct documentation dependencies. Edit this file, then regenerate the
# fully pinned requirements-docs.txt:
#
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.11 requirements-docs.in \
#     -o requirements-docs.txt
#
# The docs jobs install requirements-docs.txt, never this file.
#
# There is deliberately no --check gate on the pair. Recompiling resolves to
# whatever is newest that day, so a drift check would go red the moment an
# upstream project published a release - the exact failure the lock removes.
# Dependabot's root uv updater edits this input and recompiles the same-named
# .txt lock as a reviewed diff. PR #481 confirmed that behavior on GitHub.

